{"Display", "顯示"},
{"Unlocked", "解除鎖定"},
{"Aspect ratio", "畫面比例"},
{"Unlocked fills the window and shows more of the island on wide screens, up to ultrawide. Original keeps the game's 16:9 view with bars.", "「解除鎖定」會填滿視窗，在寬螢幕上看到更多的島嶼，最寬可到超寬螢幕。「原始」保留遊戲的16:9畫面並顯示黑邊。"},
{"Fullscreen", "全螢幕"},
{"Fills the screen. You can also press F11, Alt+Enter or Cmd+Ctrl+F.", "填滿整個螢幕。也可以按F11、Alt+Enter或Cmd+Ctrl+F。"},
{"Show FPS", "顯示FPS"},
{"Frame Generation", "影格生成"},
{"Experimental. Draws extra images between the game's frames for smoother motion. Some visual glitches are possible.", "實驗性功能。在遊戲影格之間插入額外畫面，使動作更流暢。可能出現畫面瑕疵。"},
{"Rendering", "繪製"},
{"Match display", "配合螢幕"},
{"Dynamic", "動態"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display uses your screen's resolution, and Dynamic goes as sharp as your GPU can at full speed. 1x to 4x multiply the Switch's 1080p, and 1x is 720p on this GPU. 75%%, 50%% and 25%% are for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D畫面的清晰度。「配合螢幕」使用螢幕的解析度，「動態」會在維持全速的情況下盡量提高清晰度。1x到4x是Switch 1080p的倍數，在這個GPU上1x為720p。75%%、50%%和25%%適合較慢的電腦。\n\n目前繪製解析度為%.0f x %.0f。"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display uses your screen's resolution, and Dynamic goes as sharp as your GPU can at full speed. 1x to 4x multiply the Switch's 1080p. 75%%, 50%% and 25%% are for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D畫面的清晰度。「配合螢幕」使用螢幕的解析度，「動態」會在維持全速的情況下盡量提高清晰度。1x到4x是Switch 1080p的倍數。75%%、50%%和25%%適合較慢的電腦。\n\n目前繪製解析度為%.0f x %.0f。"},
{"Dynamic is at %.0f%% of the display right now.", "「動態」目前為螢幕的%.0f%%。"},
{"Internal resolution", "內部解析度"},
{"Bilinear", "雙線性"},
{"MetalFX", "MetalFX"},
{"How the picture is scaled up when it renders below your window's resolution. MetalFX is Apple's upscaler and looks sharper, Bilinear is plain and soft.", "繪製解析度低於視窗時，畫面放大的方式。MetalFX是Apple的升頻技術，畫面較銳利；「雙線性」較單純，畫面較柔和。"},
{"AMD FSR 1", "AMD FSR 1"},
{"How the picture is scaled up when it renders below your window's resolution. AMD FSR 1 sharpens edges as it scales, Bilinear is plain and soft.", "繪製解析度低於視窗時，畫面放大的方式。AMD FSR 1會在放大時銳化邊緣；「雙線性」較單純，畫面較柔和。"},
{"Does nothing at Match display, since the game already renders at your screen's resolution.", "在「配合螢幕」時沒有作用，因為遊戲已經以螢幕解析度繪製。"},
{"Upscaler", "升頻"},
{"SMAA", "SMAA"},
{"Anti-aliasing", "反鋸齒"},
{"Smooths jagged edges. SMAA keeps textures sharp and helps most at a lower internal resolution.", "讓鋸齒狀的邊緣變平滑。SMAA能保持材質清晰，在內部解析度較低時最有效。"},
{"Remove blur", "移除模糊"},
{"Turns off the tilt-shift blur at the top and bottom of the screen.", "關閉畫面上下方的移軸模糊效果。"},
