{"Up to 15", "最多15個"},
{"Up to 30", "最多30個"},
{"Up to 40", "最多40個"},
{"All (50)", "全部（50個）"},
{"Seashell Mansion rewards", "貝殼館獎勵"},
{"How many seashells a progression item could be locked behind.", "進度道具最多可能需要多少個貝殼才能拿到。"},
{"Starting rupees", "初始盧比"},
{"Rupees in Link's wallet at the start.", "開局時林克錢包裡的盧比。"},
{"Bushsanity", "草叢模式"},
{"Every bush on the island hides an item, about 310 more checks. Bushes you haven't cut yet are golden.", "島上每個草叢都藏有道具，約多310個檢查點。尚未割過的草叢是金色的。"},
{"Digsanity", "挖掘模式"},
{"Every diggable tile on the overworld is a check, about 5,000 more. Holes stay dug.", "原野上每塊能挖的地都是檢查點，約多5,000個。挖過的洞會保留。"},
{"Shellsanity", "貝殼模式"},
{"Every hidden Secret Seashell spot holds an item from the pool.", "每個藏有秘密貝殼的地點都會放入道具池中的道具。"},
{"Applesanity", "蘋果模式"},
{"Each apple tree holds 3 items from the pool.", "每棵蘋果樹有3個來自道具池的道具。"},
{"Rocksanity", "岩石模式"},
{"Every rock you can lift on the overworld hides an item from the pool.", "原野上每個能舉起的岩石下都藏有道具池中的道具。"},
{"Small Keys", "小鑰匙"},
{"Small + Nightmare", "小鑰匙＋首領鑰匙"},
{"All dungeon items", "所有迷宮道具"},
{"Keysanity", "鑰匙模式"},
{"Dungeon keys can be anywhere. The last choice does this for every dungeon item.", "迷宮鑰匙可能在任何地方。最後一個選項對所有迷宮道具都適用。"},
{"Potsanity", "壺模式"},
{"Every pot you can lift in houses, caves and dungeons hides an item, about 400 more checks. Pots you haven't checked yet are golden.", "房屋、洞窟和迷宮裡每個能舉起的壺都藏有道具，約多400個檢查點。尚未檢查過的壺是金色的。"},
{"Vanilla prices", "原版價格"},
{"Random prices", "隨機價格"},
{"Shopsanity", "商店模式"},
{"Everything in the Mabe Village shop is a check.", "梅貝村道具店的所有商品都是檢查點。"},
{"Stealing", "偷竊"},
{"Turns on or off the ability to steal.", "開啟或關閉偷竊。"},
{"Fast Stealing", "快速偷竊"},
{"Fast Stealing doesn't require the Sword.", "快速偷竊不需要劍。"},
{"Trendy Game prizes", "流行遊戲獎品"},
{"Each of the 5 crane prize spots holds a check. Once you win one, it goes back to normal prizes.", "夾娃娃機的5個獎品位置各有一個檢查點。贏得一次後就會恢復為普通獎品。"},
{"Fishing prizes", "釣魚獎品"},
{"The fishing pond's prizes hold items from the pool.", "釣魚池的獎品是道具池中的道具。"},
{"Rapids race prizes", "急流泛舟獎品"},
{"The Rapids Ride race's prizes hold items from the pool.", "急流泛舟比賽的獎品是道具池中的道具。"},
{"Dampe's rewards", "丹培的獎勵"},
{"Dampe's Chamber Dungeon challenge rewards hold items from the pool.", "丹培嵌板迷宮考驗的獎勵是道具池中的道具。"},
{"Trade Quest Items", "交換任務道具"},
{"Progression can lie behind the Trade Quest.", "交換任務中可能有進度道具。"},
{"Color Dungeon Blupees", "衣服迷宮的藍盧比怪"},
{"The Color Dungeon's Blupees hold items from the pool.", "衣服迷宮的藍盧比怪身上有道具池中的道具。"},
{"Entrance randomizer", "入口隨機化"},
{"Shuffles where entrances lead, with logic.", "依邏輯打亂入口通往的地方。"},
{"Dungeon entrances", "迷宮入口"},
{"Dungeon entrances lead into other dungeons.", "迷宮入口會通往其他迷宮。"},
{"Houses & caves", "房屋與洞窟"},
{"Shuffles houses, caves and the caves that link two areas. Marin & Tarin's house and water entrances stay vanilla.", "打亂房屋、洞窟和連接兩個區域的洞窟。瑪林和塔林的家以及水中入口維持原版。"},
{"Decoupled entrances", "不對應入口"},
{"Leaving a house drops you outside a different door than the one you came in.", "離開房屋時，會出現在和進入時不同的門外。"},
{"Keep at least one kind of entrance shuffled, or turn the entrance randomizer off.", "請至少保留一種打亂的入口，或關閉入口隨機化。"},
{"Coupled", "對應"},
{"Decoupled", "不對應"},
{"Dungeon room shuffle", "迷宮房間打亂"},
{"Experimental. Shuffles dungeon rooms, creating new layouts.", "實驗性功能。打亂迷宮的房間，產生新的結構。"},
{"Map tracks door connections", "地圖顯示門的連接"},
{"Letter pairs on the dungeon map show which doorways connect. A pair shows up once you've used either door, and you see them all once you have the map.", "迷宮地圖上的成對字母會顯示哪些門相連。使用過其中一扇門後，該組字母就會出現；取得地圖後全部都會顯示。"},
{"Shuffle instruments", "打亂樂器"},
{"The Siren Instruments are items in the pool instead of each dungeon's reward.", "瑟蓮的樂器會放入道具池，而不是作為各迷宮的獎勵。"},
{"Open Mabe Village", "開放梅貝村"},
{"Mabe Village's paths are open from the start.", "梅貝村的道路從一開始就是開放的。"},
{"Randomize enemies", "敵人隨機化"},
{"Shuffles enemies around the island.", "打亂島上的敵人。"},
{"Seeded", "依種子"},
{"Mode", "模式"},
{"Seeded keeps enemies the same every time. Random rerolls them whenever an area loads.", "「依種子」每次的敵人都相同。「隨機」會在每次載入區域時重新決定。"},
{"Include mini-bosses", "包含中頭目"},
{"Mini-bosses join the normal enemy pool. Only some appear indoors, since the rest don't behave well in small rooms.", "中頭目會加入普通敵人池。只有部分會出現在室內，因為其他的在小房間裡無法正常運作。"},
{"Double", "雙倍"},
{"All", "全部"},
{"Mini-boss frequency", "中頭目頻率"},
{"How often overworld enemies turn into mini-bosses. All swaps every enemy that has room.", "原野敵人變成中頭目的頻率。「全部」會替換所有有空間的敵人。"},
{"Boss souls", "首領之魂"},
{"Each boss has a soul hidden in the item pool, Color Dungeon included. The boss won't show up until you find its soul, so that instrument stays locked. Found souls show on the Items screen.", "每個首領都有一個靈魂藏在道具池中，包括衣服迷宮。找到靈魂前首領不會出現，因此該樂器也無法取得。已找到的靈魂會顯示在道具畫面。"},
{"Mini-boss souls", "中頭目之魂"},
{"Each kind of mini-boss has a soul hidden in the item pool. Without it, that mini-boss won't show up and its room stays shut. One soul covers every fight with that kind.", "每種中頭目都有一個靈魂藏在道具池中。沒有靈魂的話，該中頭目不會出現，房間也會一直鎖著。一個靈魂適用於該種中頭目的所有戰鬥。"},
{"The Flying Rooster is an item. Once you find him he follows you, and the logic lets him stand in for Roc's Feather or the Hookshot.", "飛天雞是一個道具。找到後牠會跟著你，邏輯會讓牠代替洛克鳥的羽毛或鉤索。"},
{"The Ghost is an item. Once you find him, walk him to his grave for a check. He won't show up on his own after the Surf Harp.", "鬼怪是一個道具。找到後帶他到他的墳墓，就能取得一個檢查點。取得浪濤豎琴後他不會自己出現。"},
{"Companions allowed in dungeons", "同伴可進入迷宮"},
{"Companions follow Link into dungeons, and the logic counts on what they can do there, like the Flying Rooster standing in for Roc's Feather.", "同伴會跟著林克進入迷宮，邏輯會考慮他們在迷宮裡能做的事，例如由飛天雞代替洛克鳥的羽毛。"},
{"Weather Cycle", "天氣循環"},
{"Adds a weather cycle, including storm and blizzard hazards.", "加入天氣循環，包括暴風雨和暴風雪的危險。"},
{"Randomize music", "音樂隨機化"},
{"Shuffles the game's music.", "打亂遊戲的音樂。"},
{"Randomize Cosmetics", "外觀隨機化"},
{"Randomizes cosmetics to the seed.", "依種子隨機決定外觀。"},
{"Randomized Game Environments", "環境隨機化"},
{"The game has many built-in room shaders, like the desert, the Egg and the Mysterious Woods, some of them unused. The seed gives each area a random one.", "遊戲內建許多房間著色器，例如沙漠、聖蛋和不可思議森林，其中有些沒有使用過。種子會為每個區域隨機選擇一個。"},
{"Hints", "提示"},
{"Owl statues and phone booths give hints.", "貓頭鷹石像和電話亭會給予提示。"},
{"Fast songs", "快速學歌"},
{"Learning a song skips its cutscene.", "學會歌曲時略過過場動畫。"},
{"Boss cutscenes", "首領過場動畫"},
{"Plays each boss's intro cutscene.", "播放每個首領的登場動畫。"},
{"Spoiler log", "劇透紀錄"},
{"Saves a list of where every item is. Open it from the seed's Spoiler log.", "儲存每個道具位置的清單。可以從種子的「劇透紀錄」開啟。"},
{"Race mode", "競速模式"},
{"Locks the spoiler log until the credits and shows a seed hash on the title screen, so racers can check they're on the same seed.", "在片尾之前鎖住劇透紀錄，並在標題畫面顯示種子雜湊，讓參賽者確認彼此是同一個種子。"},
{"Your options", "你的選項"},
{"Seed ID", "種子ID"},
{"Easy", "簡單"},
{"Dungeon items from the start, no traps, Mabe Village open, 200 rupees.", "開局就有迷宮道具，沒有陷阱，梅貝村開放，200盧比。"},
{"Standard", "標準"},
{"The default options, plus hints and chests that match their contents.", "預設選項，加上提示和符合內容的寶箱。"},
{"Hard", "困難"},
{"Keysanity, shuffled entrances, rooms and instruments, random enemies, boss souls.", "鑰匙模式，打亂入口、房間和樂器，隨機敵人，首領之魂。"},
{"Chaos", "混沌"},
{"Every extra check and every shuffle.", "所有額外檢查點和所有打亂。"},
