{"Replace \"%s\"?", "要取代「%s」嗎？"},
{"Replace", "取代"},
{"Undo", "復原"},
{"Puts back the options you had before.", "恢復為之前的選項。"},
{"Your presets", "你的預設組合"},
{"Save current as", "將目前選項另存為"},
{"You've hit the 20 preset limit. Delete one first.", "已達到20個預設組合的上限。請先刪除一個。"},
{"Saves your current options under a name.", "以名稱儲存目前的選項。"},
{"\"%s\" is a built-in preset. Pick another name.", "「%s」是內建的預設組合。請換一個名稱。"},
{"Use, rename, update or delete it.", "使用、重新命名、更新或刪除。"},
{"Delete this seed and its save files?", "要刪除這個種子和它的存檔嗎？"},
{"Delete seed and saves", "刪除種子和存檔"},
{"Play", "遊玩"},
{"Locked", "已鎖定"},
