{"Seed ID: %s", "種子ID：%s"},
{"Race mode. Seed hash: %s", "競速模式。種子雜湊：%s"},
{"Play it, read its spoiler log, copy its ID to share, rename or delete it. Each seed has its own save files.", "可以遊玩、查看劇透紀錄、複製ID分享、重新命名或刪除。每個種子都有自己的存檔。"},
{"Playing", "遊玩中"},
{"No seeds yet", "還沒有種子"},
{"Make one with Generate seed.", "用「產生種子」建立一個。"},
{"New seed", "新種子"},
{"Seed name", "種子名稱"},
{"Name your seed, or leave it empty for a random name.", "為種子命名，留空的話會隨機取名。"},
{"Enter a shared seed ID to load its options. The same ID on the same LAS Recomp version always makes the same seed.", "輸入分享的種子ID以載入它的選項。在同版本的LAS Recomp上，相同的ID一定會產生相同的種子。"},
{"Loaded. Your options now match this ID.", "已載入。你的選項現在和這個ID相同。"},
{"Copy new seed's ID", "複製新種子的ID"},
{"Copies the ID above so you can share the seed.", "複製上方的ID，以便分享種子。"},
